# Cloudflare Pages serves index.html for client-side routes, so deep links like
# /projects/reelsensei and /about reach the router instead of 404ing.
#
# Real files are matched first, which is why robots.txt, sitemap.xml, llms.txt
# and build-info.json have to be emitted as files: anything this rule catches is
# answered with the SPA shell and a 200, not a 404.
/*    /index.html   200
